## Usage

### Account center
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="TemplateAccountDemo" code-lang="vue" description="Switch tabs; removing sessions and turning off two-factor both ask first. Sample data."}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { reactive, ref, watch } from 'vue'
  import TemplateFrame from './TemplateFrame.vue'

  // Removing a session or turning off two-factor opens a modal; only the reader's click confirms it, never a timer
  const tab = ref('profile')
  const twoFactor = ref(true)
  const sessions = ref(seedSessions())
  const confirmOpen = ref(false)
  const profile = reactive({ displayName: 'Lin Che', bio: '' })

  // While turning off, the switch stays on until the reader confirms
  let allowTwoFactorOff = false
  watch(twoFactor, (next, previous) => {
    if (allowTwoFactorOff) {
      allowTwoFactorOff = false
      return
    }
    if (next || !previous)
      return
    twoFactor.value = true
    confirmOpen.value = true
  })
  </script>

  <template>
    <TemplateFrame title="Account" :height="620">
      <template #default="{ width }">
        <header class="account__head">
          <TxAvatar name="Lin Che" :size="56" />
          <strong>Lin Che</strong>
          <TxStatusBadge size="sm" text="Email verified" status="success" icon="i-carbon-checkmark-filled" />
        </header>

        <TxTabs v-model="tab" :placement="width > 0 && width < 640 ? 'top' : 'left'" borderless>
          <TxTabItemGroup name="Account">
            <TxTabItem name="profile" icon-class="i-carbon-user">
              <template #name>Profile</template>
              <TuffInput v-model="profile.displayName" aria-label="Display name" />
              <TuffInput model-value="lin_che" readonly aria-label="Username" />
              <TuffInput model-value="lin.che@example.com" readonly aria-label="Email" />
              <TxTextarea v-model="profile.bio" :rows="3" resize="none" />
            </TxTabItem>

            <TxTabItem name="security" icon-class="i-carbon-security">
              <template #name>Security</template>
              <TxGroupBlock name="Sign-in" :collapsible="false">
                <TxBlockSlot title="Two-factor sign-in" description="Ask for a code from your authenticator on sign-in">
                  <TuffSwitch v-model="twoFactor" aria-label="Two-factor sign-in" />
                </TxBlockSlot>
              </TxGroupBlock>
            </TxTabItem>

            <TxTabItem name="sessions" icon-class="i-carbon-devices">
              <template #name>Sessions</template>
              <TxDataTable :columns="tableColumns" :data="sessions" row-key="id" table-layout="fixed" sticky-header>
                <template #cell-device="{ row }">
                  {{ row.device }}
                  <TxTag v-if="row.current" label="This device" variant="soft" />
                </template>
                <template #cell-actions="{ row }">
                  <TxIconButton v-if="!row.current" icon="i-carbon-trash-can" size="xs" label="Remove session" @click="askRemove(row.id)" />
                </template>
              </TxDataTable>
              <TxCard variant="dashed" :padding="16" :radius="14">
                <TxButton variant="danger" size="sm" @click="askRemoveOthers">Remove other sessions</TxButton>
              </TxCard>
            </TxTabItem>

            <TxTabItem name="notifications" icon-class="i-carbon-notification">
              <template #name>Notifications</template>
              <TuffSwitch v-model="notify.product" aria-label="Product updates" />
              <TuffSwitch v-model="notify.security" disabled aria-label="Security alerts" />
            </TxTabItem>
          </TxTabItemGroup>
        </TxTabs>

        <TxModal v-model="confirmOpen" title="Confirm action">
          <template #footer>
            <TxButton size="sm" variant="ghost" @click="confirmOpen = false">Cancel</TxButton>
            <TxButton size="sm" variant="danger" @click="confirmAction">Confirm</TxButton>
          </template>
        </TxModal>

        <TxToastPanel :open="toastOpen" side="above" :stack="0">Saved</TxToastPanel>
      </template>
    </TemplateFrame>
  </template>
---
:::

## Overview

The Tuff account center: profile, security, sessions and notifications on one page, with the avatar and email verification always shown in the header.

- Display name and bio are editable; username and email are read-only, and saving shows a short notice.
- The two-factor switch asks before it turns off and stays on until the reader confirms.
- Sessions lists signed-in devices and tags the current one as "This device"; removing one session or all others asks first.
- The danger zone holds one action, Remove other sessions, and no timer runs it; the button is disabled when there are no other sessions.
- Security alerts stay on in notifications. Wide (≥ 960px) adds an App column; narrow (< 640px) moves the tabs to the top and keeps only the device and action columns.

## Customization

- With a real account, replace the sample data with the account service's API; the avatar, email and verification come from the service, not a copy in the template.
- Removing sessions and turning off two-factor should call the API only after the modal is confirmed; on failure, keep the modal open and offer a retry.
- The "This device" tag comes from the current session the server returns, not from a guess in the front end.
- Keep security alerts fixed on in any new notification row, and explain why in its description.

